profile: tinyrustlm.next-recursive-prompt.v2
updated_utc: 2026-07-02T00:12:07Z
prompt: |
  Continue the TinyRustLM developer portal from version 1.5.0. Preserve the zero-dependency PHP/CSS/vanilla JS stack, keep footer text "Contact Mike Kappel" linked to /contact/, keep TinyRustLM centered on the browser-local Rust/WASM SLM runtime, and treat TinyRustLM.com as the root public app. Runtime.MiRust.com is retired as a separate documentation authority; its preserved implementation evidence lives under docs/runtime-portal/ and is indexed by docs/runtime-portal/MANIFEST.md. Before changes, read workspace.uai, .uai/index.uai, .uai/short-term-memory.uai, .uai/long-term-memory.uai, docs/runtime-portal/MANIFEST.md, docs/report-index.md, and docs/long-term-memory.md. If new reports are supplied, preserve full bodies under docs/reports or the configured report-intake archive, update docs/report-index.md, update docs/long-term-memory.md when the current truth boundary changes, and add pointer records to .uai/long-term-memory.uai with checksums and deep links.
